      <p class="lead" style="max-width:none;">MSNA Cleaning & Support is the cleaning and support division of MSNA Group Services, alongside MSNA-Mode. Led by founder Shauki Ridouani, MSNA Cleaning & Support focuses on clear, professional service for offices, showrooms, washrooms and other business premises.</p>
      <p class="lead" style="max-width:none;">Our approach is simple: listen first, agree on the details, then carry out the work. Every location gets a task plan shaped around the space, how it is used and what you expect, with one consistent point of contact from first conversation to evaluation.</p>
      <div class="callout"><p>Mentality, status, standard and ambition, the same values behind MSNA-Mode, shape Cleaning & Support too: clarity and craftsmanship first.</p></div>
